{
    "title": "Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand!",
    "description": "\ud83d\udd0d Test your brand knowledge with Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand! The ultimate logo game.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udca1 With over 1000 logos and regular updates, you'll never run out of fun. Play through different categories like:\r\n\ud83d\ude97 Cars\r\n\ud83c\udf54 Food\r\n\u26bd Soccer\r\n\ud83c\udfa4 Kpop\r\n\ud83c\udfae Video Games\r\n\ud83e\uddb8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Superheroes\r\n\ud83c\udfac Movies\r\nAnd much more!\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfae But that's not all! Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand also includes fun features like:\r\n\ud83c\udf08 Colorful graphics\r\n\ud83d\udd0a Sound effects\r\n\ud83d\udfe2 Play offline for free anytime, anywhere, no internet connection required\r\n\ud83d\udca1 Useful hints to help you out\r\n\ud83d\uddd3 Daily Challenge with exciting rewards\r\n\ud83c\udd95 Frequent updates with new logos and categories\r\n\r\n\ud83e\udde0 Not only is Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand a fun way to pass the time, it also trains and improves your memory. Good for the brain and good for the fun!\r\n\r\n\u23f0 So why wait? Download now and start guessing!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udc51 Whether you're a trivia pro or just looking for a casual game to pass the time, Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand has something for everyone. Try it out now and see how many logos you can identify from around the world.\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udfc6 Do you have what it takes to become a brand master? Play Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand and find out! \ud83c\udfc6",
    "descriptionHTML": "\ud83d\udd0d Test your brand knowledge with Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand! The ultimate logo game.<br><br>\ud83d\udca1 With over 1000 logos and regular updates, you&#39;ll never run out of fun. Play through different categories like:<br>\ud83d\ude97 Cars<br>\ud83c\udf54 Food<br>\u26bd Soccer<br>\ud83c\udfa4 Kpop<br>\ud83c\udfae Video Games<br>\ud83e\uddb8\u200d\u2642\ufe0f Superheroes<br>\ud83c\udfac Movies<br>And much more!<br><br>\ud83c\udfae But that&#39;s not all! Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand also includes fun features like:<br>\ud83c\udf08 Colorful graphics<br>\ud83d\udd0a Sound effects<br>\ud83d\udfe2 Play offline for free anytime, anywhere, no internet connection required<br>\ud83d\udca1 Useful hints to help you out<br>\ud83d\uddd3 Daily Challenge with exciting rewards<br>\ud83c\udd95 Frequent updates with new logos and categories<br><br>\ud83e\udde0 Not only is Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand a fun way to pass the time, it also trains and improves your memory. Good for the brain and good for the fun!<br><br>\u23f0 So why wait? Download now and start guessing!<br><br>\ud83d\udc51 Whether you&#39;re a trivia pro or just looking for a casual game to pass the time, Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand has something for everyone. Try it out now and see how many logos you can identify from around the world.<br><br>\ud83c\udfc6 Do you have what it takes to become a brand master? Play Logo Quiz: Guess the Brand and find out! \ud83c\udfc6",
